  "title": "Custom Name Catcher Batter Baseball Baseball Throw, Baseba - Design 13",
  "handle": "custom-name-catcher-batter-baseball-baseball-throw-baseba-design-13",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the baseball enthusiast in your life with this custom baseball throw blanket from Jeminise. Designed for coziness and team spirit, this personalized blanket makes a thoughtful gift for any baseball player, coach, or fan.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with the name and number of your favorite baseball player, making it a truly unique and cherished item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from Sherpa and Fleece fabric, featuring two layers of Polyester for a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in four convenient sizes to suit various needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for men, women, moms, dads, and baseball players for occasions like Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or New Year's.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a dedicated baseball design with a sporty theme, perfect for fans of the game.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash separately in cold water, air dry without heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
